tunity to improve access  to evidence-based care and with a  retention rate of 90 percent for her  program  she has little doubt this is the future  of canada's health care systems  jamie morocco global news toronto and  that is global national  for this saturday night i'm robin gill  tonight your canada is harrison hot  springs  in british columbia we'd love to see  you're part of this country so please  keep sending your photos to viewers at  globalnational.com  thank you for watching and i'll see you  back here tomorrow have a great night
 

